{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(numbers: list[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the ratio of zero elements to non-zero elements in a list of integers.\n    Returns 0.0 if non_zero_count is 0.\"\"\"\n    zero_count_val = 0\n    non_zero_count_val = 0\n\n    for element in numbers:\n        if element == 0:\n            zero_count_val += 1\n        else:\n            non_zero_count_val += 1\n\n    if non_zero_count_val == 0:\n        computed_ratio = 0.0\n    else:\n        computed_ratio = float(zero_count_val) / non_zero_count_val\n\n    return computed_ratio"}
