{"task_id": "Mbpp/223", "solution": "import bisect\ndef is_majority(array: list[int], n: int, element: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if an element is the majority element in a sorted array.\n    A majority element occurs more than n/2 times.\n    \"\"\"\n    first_occurrence_index = bisect.bisect_left(array, element)\n\n    # If the element is not found or is out of bounds, it cannot be a majority.\n    if first_occurrence_index == n or array[first_occurrence_index] != element:\n        return False\n\n    last_occurrence_index = bisect.bisect_right(array, element)\n\n    count = last_occurrence_index - first_occurrence_index\n\n    # Check if the count exceeds n/2.\n    return count > n / 2"}
