{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "import collections\ndef validate(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the frequency of each digit in the integer is less than or equal to the digit itself.\n    Returns False if the digit '0' is present or if any digit's frequency exceeds its value.\n    \"\"\"\n    s_number = str(abs(number))\n    digit_counts = collections.Counter(s_number)\n\n    if '0' in digit_counts:\n        return False\n\n    for digit_char, frequency in digit_counts.items():\n        digit_value = int(digit_char)\n        if frequency > digit_value:\n            return False\n\n    return True"}
