{"task_id": "Mbpp/410", "solution": "def min_val(input_list: list) -> int | float | None:\n    \"\"\"Filters non-numeric elements from a list and returns the minimum numeric value.\n\n    Args:\n        input_list: A heterogeneous list containing elements of various types.\n\n    Returns:\n        The minimum numeric value (int or float) from the filtered list, or None if no numeric elements are found.\n    \"\"\"\n    numeric_elements = []\n    for element in input_list:\n        if isinstance(element, (int, float)):\n            numeric_elements.append(element)\n\n    if not numeric_elements:\n        return None\n    else:\n        return min(numeric_elements)"}
