{"task_id": "Mbpp/420", "solution": "def cube_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the cubes of the first n even natural numbers. Assumes n is an integer >= 1.\"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        even_number = 2 * i\n        cubed_value = even_number ** 3\n        total_sum += cubed_value\n    return total_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/419", "solution": "def round_and_sum(numbers: list[float | int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Rounds each number in the input list, sums the rounded numbers,\n    and multiplies the sum by the length of the original list.\n    \"\"\"\n    list_length = len(numbers)\n    sum_of_rounded_numbers = 0\n    for num in numbers:\n        sum_of_rounded_numbers += round(num)\n    final_product = sum_of_rounded_numbers * list_length\n    return final_product"}
