{"task_id": "Mbpp/430", "solution": "def parabola_directrix(a: float, b: float, c: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the y-coordinate of the directrix for a parabola given its coefficients.\n    Raises ValueError if 'a' is zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    if a == 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Coefficient 'a' cannot be zero.\")\n    \n    # Formula for the directrix of a parabola y = ax^2 + bx + c is y = c - (b^2 + 1) / (4a)\n    directrix = c - (b**2 + 1) / (4 * a)\n    return directrix"}
