{"task_id": "Mbpp/555", "solution": "def _calculate_sum_n(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the first n natural numbers using the formula n * (n + 1) / 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    return n * (n + 1) // 2\ndef _calculate_sum_cubes_n(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the cubes of the first n natural numbers using the formula (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2.\n    \"\"\"\n    sum_of_n = _calculate_sum_n(n)\n    return sum_of_n ** 2\ndef difference(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the difference between the sum of the cubes of the first n natural numbers\n    and the sum of the first n natural numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    _validate_natural_number(n)\n\n    sum_of_n = _calculate_sum_n(n)\n    sum_of_cubes_n = _calculate_sum_cubes_n(n)\n\n    return sum_of_cubes_n - sum_of_n"}
