{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "import math\ndef wind_chill(temperature_celsius: float, wind_velocity_kmh: float) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the wind chill index using the standard formula and rounds down to the nearest integer.\n    The formula is Twc = 13.12 + 0.6215Ta - 11.37V^0.16 + 0.3965TaV^0.16.\n    \"\"\"\n    Ta = temperature_celsius\n    V = wind_velocity_kmh\n    \n    # Calculate V^0.16 once to avoid repeated computation\n    V_pow_0_16 = V**0.16\n    \n    Twc = 13.12 + (0.6215 * Ta) - (11.37 * V_pow_0_16) + (0.3965 * Ta * V_pow_0_16)\n    \n    # Round down to the nearest integer as per design requirements (FR4)\n    return math.floor(Twc)"}
